\ Target module for the finalized-module arm of borrow_deps.1z. It calls `(secret)` by name, which is
\ undefined at load time. An unknown callee is deferred to runtime, so this loads cleanly. The test
\ injects `(secret)` into this module's deps via native.borrow-deps before calling run-secret.

run-secret: ( -- string ) [ (secret) ] ;
